# Starfall Reverie — sprites & roster

**Canonical doc (read fully when touching portraits, battles, or party UI):** `docs/agent-starfall-sprites.md`

## Non‑negotiables

- **No PNG/SVG sprite sheets** for heroes: art is **`Starfall.drawPortrait(canvas, character, { size })`** in `shared/starfall.js` (procedural Canvas).
- **Single source of truth:** roster + drawing live in `shared/starfall.js`. **Do not** copy `drawPortrait` into other files.
- **Load order:** any page needs `<script src="shared/starfall.js"></script>` (path relative to page) **before** scripts that use `window.Starfall`.
- **Imports:** guard with `typeof Starfall === "undefined"` or ensure HTML load order — there is **no npm/React requirement** unless the page adds its own toolchain.

## API cheat sheet

- `Starfall.getCharacter(id)` — may return `undefined`; handle that.
- `Starfall.drawPortrait(canvas, char, opts?)`
- Party / pulls: `Starfall.Unlocks.isUnlocked(id)`, `Starfall.Unlocks.getUnlockedCharacters()`.

When adding playable characters everyone shares, extend **`shared/starfall.js`** (roster entries + rarity), not duplicated battle-only assets.
